# `git.diff`

Diff for a commit or 'WORKING'.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.git.read`. ⚠️ sensitive — payload may carry secrets or git content.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `commit` | `string` | yes |
| `workspace_id` | `string?` | no |

## Returns

